{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19876","headline":"出东门 · 孟郊","name":"出东门","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"饿马骨亦耸，独驱出东门。\n少年一日程，衰叟十日奔。\n寒景不我爲，疾走落平原。\n眇默荒草行，恐惧夜魄翻。\n一生自组织，千首大雅言。\n道路如抽蚕，宛转羁肠繁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19876.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19876","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}